<b>040915, JunkerIn:</b> This is where we talk about the associated page, but since this is the start of a FAQ project, I suggest as well any project talk can go here.

<b>041006, BillStClair:</b> I don't like naming pages for their position in the outline. Maybe OpenSourceFAQ/WhatIsLinux and OpenSourceFAQ/GettingLinux? If you do not object, I'll be happy to do the renaming.

<b>041007, JunkerIn:</b> I say go for it. The current names look grungy and have to be renamed after every insertion/deletion. Better to make them position independent. Thanks.

<b>041017, BillStClair:</b> Done.
